1
00:00:03,220 --> 00:00:07,250
♪By red walls and a dry well,
my crown gathers dust and frost♪

2
00:00:07,640 --> 00:00:11,860
♪With a hoe and a patch of wasteland,
I sow the moonlight♪

3
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:16,120
♪Who says the Cold Palace
holds nothing but tears?♪

4
00:00:16,310 --> 00:00:20,330
♪I choose to fill it with fragrant wine♪

5
00:00:20,670 --> 00:00:22,200
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

6
00:00:22,250 --> 00:00:24,730
♪Growing life's simple joys♪

7
00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:26,880
♪Bins full of grain, jars full of wine♪

8
00:00:26,970 --> 00:00:28,760
♪Better than dancing in silks♪

9
00:00:29,420 --> 00:00:30,650
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

10
00:00:30,930 --> 00:00:33,320
♪My heart longs for the world beyond♪

11
00:00:33,690 --> 00:00:35,800
♪Tending a courtyard full of life♪

12
00:00:36,140 --> 00:00:40,560
♪Come, share a cup with me♪

13
00:00:40,570 --> 00:00:42,540
(Welcome to Cold Palace Refreshments)

14
00:00:45,720 --> 00:00:47,040
=Farm Busily in the Cold Palace=

15
00:00:47,040 --> 00:00:48,620
(Based on Hongshu.com's novel
I'm Busy Farming in the Cold Palace)

16
00:00:48,620 --> 00:00:49,650
=Episode 22=

17
00:00:50,320 --> 00:00:51,079
Your Highness.

18
00:00:51,079 --> 00:00:51,560
Here.

19
00:00:53,039 --> 00:00:53,880
Please sit.

20
00:00:56,600 --> 00:00:57,320
Your Highness,

21
00:00:57,320 --> 00:00:58,679
the first supplies have arrived.

22
00:00:58,679 --> 00:00:59,200
Oh.

23
00:00:59,600 --> 00:01:01,399
The palace made these as you instructed.

24
00:01:01,399 --> 00:01:02,439
They're...

25
00:01:03,119 --> 00:01:03,640
face...

26
00:01:03,640 --> 00:01:04,840
face masks and gloves.

27
00:01:04,840 --> 00:01:05,480
Huh?

28
00:01:07,840 --> 00:01:08,879
What are these?

29
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:09,599
Well,

30
00:01:10,799 --> 00:01:11,879
these masks

31
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:13,560
keep out droplets.

32
00:01:13,799 --> 00:01:16,319
Gloves prevent direct contact with
patients.

33
00:01:17,040 --> 00:01:18,359
That's basic protection.

34
00:01:18,560 --> 00:01:19,640
To save others,

35
00:01:19,640 --> 00:01:21,400
first learn to protect yourself.

36
00:01:22,120 --> 00:01:22,640
Like this?

37
00:01:22,640 --> 00:01:23,879
Yes, that's right.

38
00:01:23,879 --> 00:01:26,280
(She's so organized,)

39
00:01:26,359 --> 00:01:28,159
(and never complained on the journey.)

40
00:01:28,480 --> 00:01:32,439
(Nothing like the wicked sorceress
the Empress Dowager described.)

41
00:01:33,040 --> 00:01:34,439
(Could an empress like her)

42
00:01:34,560 --> 00:01:37,400
(really bring disaster to Donglan?)

43
00:01:38,200 --> 00:01:39,000
Like this.

44
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:44,840
(Tailing County Office)

45
00:01:48,040 --> 00:01:48,959
Sir,

46
00:01:48,959 --> 00:01:50,799
the imperial party is outside the city.

47
00:01:51,319 --> 00:01:52,840
They'll reach Tailing County tomorrow.

48
00:01:52,840 --> 00:01:53,840
(Magistrate Cao)

49
00:01:53,840 --> 00:01:54,799
So soon?

50
00:01:56,879 --> 00:01:58,319
Which official have they sent?

51
00:01:58,640 --> 00:02:00,480
The Empress herself,

52
00:02:00,640 --> 00:02:02,599
accompanied by Prince Rui.

53
00:02:02,599 --> 00:02:03,879
Ahem.

54
00:02:05,680 --> 00:02:06,480
Sir,

55
00:02:06,480 --> 00:02:08,759
the symptoms suggest smallpox.

56
00:02:12,120 --> 00:02:13,199
It's smallpox?

57
00:02:13,199 --> 00:02:13,800
Yes.

58
00:02:17,199 --> 00:02:18,280
Seal off the streets

59
00:02:18,280 --> 00:02:19,520
and inform the court at once.

60
00:02:19,719 --> 00:02:20,520
Yes, sir.

61
00:02:22,520 --> 00:02:24,919
Magistrate Cao, a word in private?

62
00:02:25,560 --> 00:02:26,759
I have no time for you.

63
00:02:26,759 --> 00:02:27,520
Get out of my way.

64
00:02:27,520 --> 00:02:28,439
Sir,

65
00:02:28,439 --> 00:02:29,919
keep this quiet,

66
00:02:30,439 --> 00:02:32,719
and 10,000 in gold is yours.

67
00:02:33,319 --> 00:02:36,080
Your silence buys a lifetime of luxury.

68
00:02:43,879 --> 00:02:44,960
Sir,

69
00:02:44,960 --> 00:02:46,960
this is clearly smallpox.

70
00:02:47,080 --> 00:02:48,919
I couldn't be mistaken!

71
00:02:51,120 --> 00:02:51,919
You!

72
00:02:52,159 --> 00:02:54,159
How dare you spread such lies!

73
00:02:54,360 --> 00:02:54,840
This...

74
00:02:54,840 --> 00:02:56,520
This is clearly just a common cold!

75
00:02:56,960 --> 00:02:58,199
Guards!

76
00:02:58,199 --> 00:03:00,879
Throw this enemy spy in jail!

77
00:03:02,520 --> 00:03:03,080
Prince...

78
00:03:03,080 --> 00:03:04,800
Where is Prince Chen now?

79
00:03:05,759 --> 00:03:07,439
Have you forgotten, sir?

80
00:03:07,680 --> 00:03:11,280
You personally had those burdens dumped
at the burial ground,

81
00:03:11,680 --> 00:03:13,000
to fend for themselves.

82
00:03:13,479 --> 00:03:14,759
But Prince Chen

83
00:03:14,919 --> 00:03:15,919
defied your orders

84
00:03:15,919 --> 00:03:18,960
and insisted on sheltering and treating
them in that old morgue.

85
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:20,360
A true saint.

86
00:03:21,759 --> 00:03:23,520
If this gets out,

87
00:03:23,599 --> 00:03:25,319
I'm a dead man!

88
00:03:27,000 --> 00:03:28,199
No.

89
00:03:28,199 --> 00:03:29,759
I can't just wait to die.

90
00:03:32,360 --> 00:03:33,080
Ready my horse.

91
00:03:33,080 --> 00:03:34,719
I must leave the city today.

92
00:03:35,039 --> 00:03:36,719
The imperial party is just outside.

93
00:03:37,080 --> 00:03:39,360
It's too late to run.

94
00:03:42,080 --> 00:03:43,520
I know a dog hole.

95
00:03:43,599 --> 00:03:44,599
Sir,

96
00:03:44,599 --> 00:03:47,360
would you really flee like a stray dog,

97
00:03:47,639 --> 00:03:49,520
crawling out through a dog hole,

98
00:03:50,639 --> 00:03:51,840
give up your office,

99
00:03:52,039 --> 00:03:52,840
lose everything,

100
00:03:53,960 --> 00:03:55,240
and spend your life on the run?

101
00:03:58,719 --> 00:03:59,919
If you ask me,

102
00:04:00,639 --> 00:04:01,919
rather than flee,

103
00:04:01,919 --> 00:04:03,120
why not

104
00:04:04,599 --> 00:04:07,360
blame it all on

105
00:04:08,439 --> 00:04:09,479
that saint?

106
00:04:11,280 --> 00:04:13,680
Dead men tell no tales.

107
00:04:13,719 --> 00:04:16,839
You'll still be Tailing County's
magistrate.

108
00:04:36,480 --> 00:04:37,519
Your Highness.

109
00:04:38,279 --> 00:04:39,319
Your Highness!

110
00:04:40,240 --> 00:04:42,439
Please leave!

111
00:04:42,439 --> 00:04:43,720
This disease...

112
00:04:43,720 --> 00:04:46,439
It's too terrible!

113
00:04:46,800 --> 00:04:48,279
Tailing County...

114
00:04:48,279 --> 00:04:50,800
Tailing County is beyond saving!

115
00:04:51,839 --> 00:04:53,439
I've had smallpox before.

116
00:04:54,120 --> 00:04:55,759
I was lucky enough to survive.

117
00:04:56,639 --> 00:04:58,040
Since then, I've tested it

118
00:04:58,279 --> 00:04:59,480
and found I can't get it again.

119
00:05:02,879 --> 00:05:04,600
I don't know why,

120
00:05:05,160 --> 00:05:06,519
but if I can work it out,

121
00:05:07,079 --> 00:05:08,800
perhaps I can save more people.

122
00:05:09,519 --> 00:05:11,000
Your Highness!

123
00:05:20,319 --> 00:05:21,120
Your Highness!

124
00:05:21,800 --> 00:05:24,040
More fresh graves at the eastern site.

125
00:05:24,319 --> 00:05:25,720
As you ordered,

126
00:05:25,920 --> 00:05:28,079
we dug out everyone still breathing.

127
00:05:28,439 --> 00:05:29,680
But this man

128
00:05:30,680 --> 00:05:33,160
may not survive the night.

129
00:05:34,240 --> 00:05:37,519
Cao Zhida is depraved! He's burying
people alive!

130
00:05:37,920 --> 00:05:38,879
Your Highness,

131
00:05:38,879 --> 00:05:39,879
if you hadn't risked your life

132
00:05:39,879 --> 00:05:41,360
to shelter all of us here,

133
00:05:41,360 --> 00:05:43,759
while those corrupt officials won't come
near for fear of the epidemic,

134
00:05:44,319 --> 00:05:47,040
Tailing County would soon become
a ghost town.

135
00:05:49,839 --> 00:05:51,480
Any word from the court?

136
00:05:51,639 --> 00:05:53,040
Since the city was sealed,

137
00:05:53,360 --> 00:05:54,639
no pigeons have made it out.

138
00:05:54,879 --> 00:05:57,199
None of our messengers have returned.

139
00:05:59,680 --> 00:06:01,040
Keep trying to send word.

140
00:06:01,680 --> 00:06:02,759
For now, save who we can.

141
00:06:02,759 --> 00:06:03,439
Yes, sir.

142
00:06:06,160 --> 00:06:07,120
My lady,

143
00:06:07,360 --> 00:06:08,360
it's midnight.

144
00:06:08,519 --> 00:06:09,639
Get some rest.

145
00:06:10,680 --> 00:06:11,920
I don't know why,

146
00:06:13,160 --> 00:06:14,639
but I feel uneasy,

147
00:06:15,480 --> 00:06:17,560
as if something terrible will happen.

148
00:06:20,959 --> 00:06:21,600
Oh.

149
00:06:22,319 --> 00:06:24,319
I've had no chance to ask on the road.

150
00:06:24,839 --> 00:06:26,040
Why did you two come along?

151
00:06:26,959 --> 00:06:28,560
His Majesty ordered us...

152
00:06:28,560 --> 00:06:29,319
Brother!

153
00:06:29,319 --> 00:06:30,639
Why not tell her the truth?

154
00:06:30,720 --> 00:06:32,079
We were worried about Her Highness

155
00:06:32,079 --> 00:06:33,680
and knelt to beg His Majesty's leave.

156
00:06:38,399 --> 00:06:39,959
How long have you served Ji Wujue?

157
00:06:41,040 --> 00:06:41,959
I've lost count.

158
00:06:42,199 --> 00:06:43,439
Shadow guards train from childhood

159
00:06:43,639 --> 00:06:44,920
and serve only the emperor.

160
00:06:46,959 --> 00:06:47,920
(They're utterly loyal.)

161
00:06:48,279 --> 00:06:49,519
(I suppose I can tell them.)

162
00:06:50,680 --> 00:06:51,720
Now that I'm out,

163
00:06:52,560 --> 00:06:53,759
I don't plan to go back.

164
00:06:53,759 --> 00:06:54,759
My lady!

165
00:06:56,199 --> 00:06:56,839
Your Highness,

166
00:06:57,160 --> 00:06:59,160
can you bear to leave His Majesty?

167
00:07:00,639 --> 00:07:01,839
I'd be lying if I said yes.

168
00:07:03,360 --> 00:07:04,839
But those palace walls are so high.

169
00:07:05,680 --> 00:07:07,800
I can't let a little heartache

170
00:07:08,360 --> 00:07:09,600
keep me trapped there.

171
00:07:10,680 --> 00:07:11,759
Your Highness,

172
00:07:12,560 --> 00:07:13,560
what do you plan to do?

173
00:07:14,160 --> 00:07:15,279
Make money.

174
00:07:15,360 --> 00:07:16,720
Lots and lots of money.

175
00:07:19,439 --> 00:07:20,399
The other day,

176
00:07:21,160 --> 00:07:22,680
His Majesty asked about my dreams.

177
00:07:22,800 --> 00:07:23,680
I drew a blank.

178
00:07:23,680 --> 00:07:24,759
I had no answer.

179
00:07:24,759 --> 00:07:25,800
I didn't know what to say.

180
00:07:25,879 --> 00:07:27,160
But now I do.

181
00:07:29,160 --> 00:07:32,040
I'll use farming to drive the economy.

182
00:07:32,600 --> 00:07:34,759
I'll build the world's leading farming
and trade guild,

183
00:07:34,879 --> 00:07:36,720
open trade routes to Xiqing,

184
00:07:36,720 --> 00:07:38,560
sell textiles from Liu,

185
00:07:38,560 --> 00:07:41,199
raise Beicang's cattle and sheep,

186
00:07:41,199 --> 00:07:42,759
and import Southern Borderlands spices.

187
00:07:42,839 --> 00:07:45,879
I'll make Donglan's granaries overflow.

188
00:07:46,800 --> 00:07:47,720
Your Highness,

189
00:07:47,839 --> 00:07:50,000
that's more than a dream.

190
00:07:50,000 --> 00:07:51,560
You mean to change the world!

191
00:07:54,439 --> 00:07:56,079
Now I understand

192
00:07:56,079 --> 00:07:58,439
why His Majesty let you go.

193
00:07:59,319 --> 00:08:00,399
Well, well!

194
00:08:00,480 --> 00:08:01,959
Eating without me?

195
00:08:02,560 --> 00:08:04,160
Someone followed his nose here.

196
00:08:09,279 --> 00:08:10,240
Your Highness,

197
00:08:10,360 --> 00:08:12,040
our scouts report

198
00:08:12,040 --> 00:08:13,639
all four gates of Tailing are shut.

199
00:08:13,839 --> 00:08:17,120
The guards ignored our imperial banners.

200
00:08:21,079 --> 00:08:22,920
That's not normal.

201
00:08:23,199 --> 00:08:24,160
Your Highness,

202
00:08:24,160 --> 00:08:25,959
I studied the stars tonight.

203
00:08:26,120 --> 00:08:28,000
The Emperor Star is dim,

204
00:08:28,120 --> 00:08:30,160
and the Wolf Star invades the center.

205
00:08:30,160 --> 00:08:31,120
In plain language.

206
00:08:32,679 --> 00:08:34,960
The stars foretell

207
00:08:35,080 --> 00:08:38,919
bloodshed in the imperial family.

208
00:08:39,240 --> 00:08:40,759
What utter rubbish!

209
00:08:40,879 --> 00:08:42,399
I'm right here, perfectly fine!

210
00:08:42,399 --> 00:08:43,399
Who are you cursing?

211
00:08:44,039 --> 00:08:45,120
I wouldn't dare!

212
00:08:45,320 --> 00:08:47,639
You spouted nonsense at court

213
00:08:47,679 --> 00:08:49,279
and sent my sister-in-law into danger!

214
00:08:49,600 --> 00:08:51,360
Now you're after me too?

215
00:08:51,799 --> 00:08:54,519
I was blinded by greed before!

216
00:08:54,519 --> 00:08:56,000
This time, I got it right!

217
00:08:56,039 --> 00:08:58,600
I'll stake my life on it!

218
00:08:58,600 --> 00:08:59,879
When have you ever been right?

219
00:08:59,879 --> 00:09:00,679
Wait.

220
00:09:03,759 --> 00:09:06,159
You're not the only prince here.

221
00:09:08,480 --> 00:09:09,799
The gates are shut for no reason,

222
00:09:10,279 --> 00:09:11,559
and there's no word from Prince Chen.

223
00:09:12,960 --> 00:09:13,759
Ready the horses!

224
00:09:13,919 --> 00:09:14,440
Yes!

225
00:09:18,159 --> 00:09:19,960
Wake up. Hold on.

226
00:09:20,759 --> 00:09:22,879
Make it through tonight, and you'll feel
better.

227
00:09:23,480 --> 00:09:25,440
Such compassion, Your Highness.

228
00:09:25,440 --> 00:09:26,440
Why not

229
00:09:26,480 --> 00:09:28,399
feed the poor in the underworld?

230
00:09:28,679 --> 00:09:29,480
Your Highness!

231
00:09:30,556 --> 00:09:31,360
Protect the prince!

232
00:09:31,360 --> 00:09:32,840
Your Highness!

233
00:09:34,879 --> 00:09:37,000
Filthy peasants! You ask for death!

234
00:09:43,799 --> 00:09:46,240
These peasants dare rise in rebellion!

235
00:09:46,399 --> 00:09:47,159
Seize them!

236
00:09:48,240 --> 00:09:49,759
So it is you, you corrupt scoundrel!

237
00:09:51,080 --> 00:09:52,360
Fight him!

238
00:09:52,440 --> 00:09:53,159
Kill him!

239
00:10:05,919 --> 00:10:06,799
Cao Zhida!

240
00:10:07,720 --> 00:10:08,519
You...

241
00:10:09,360 --> 00:10:10,799
You're badly hurt, Your Highness.

242
00:10:11,080 --> 00:10:12,879
Best save your breath.

243
00:10:14,799 --> 00:10:18,039
I'll send you on your way.

244
00:10:19,799 --> 00:10:22,440
Ah!

245
00:10:25,960 --> 00:10:27,799
Hiding the outbreak, lying to the court,

246
00:10:27,799 --> 00:10:28,759
attacking royalty...

247
00:10:29,200 --> 00:10:31,519
You dare, you corrupt scoundrel!

248
00:10:33,879 --> 00:10:35,000
Kill him!

249
00:11:00,320 --> 00:11:04,350
♪By red walls and a dry well,
my crown gathers dust and frost♪

250
00:11:04,740 --> 00:11:08,960
♪With a hoe and a patch of wasteland,
I sow the moonlight♪

251
00:11:09,000 --> 00:11:13,180
♪Who says the Cold Palace
holds nothing but tears?♪

252
00:11:13,240 --> 00:11:17,430
♪I choose to fill it with fragrant wine♪

253
00:11:17,770 --> 00:11:21,830
♪Cool dew, starry nights,
wheat sprouts in my hands♪

254
00:11:21,900 --> 00:11:26,080
♪I shape fields, not painted brows,
and fill them with hope♪

255
00:11:26,520 --> 00:11:29,890
♪Gold and silver bloom from the soil♪

256
00:11:30,360 --> 00:11:35,040
♪I smile as the world storms on♪

257
00:11:36,700 --> 00:11:38,850
♪No finery to rival spring♪

258
00:11:39,030 --> 00:11:43,330
♪All I wish for are waves of green♪

259
00:11:45,740 --> 00:11:47,490
♪Where is beauty found?♪

260
00:11:47,670 --> 00:11:52,100
♪Just lift your eyes and see♪

261
00:11:52,660 --> 00:11:54,230
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

262
00:11:54,250 --> 00:11:56,720
♪Growing life's simple joys♪

263
00:11:56,790 --> 00:11:58,870
♪Bins full of grain, jars full of wine♪

264
00:11:59,030 --> 00:12:00,800
♪Better than dancing in silks♪

265
00:12:01,410 --> 00:12:02,680
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

266
00:12:02,910 --> 00:12:05,310
♪My heart longs for the world beyond♪

267
00:12:05,550 --> 00:12:07,850
♪Tending a courtyard full of life♪

268
00:12:08,130 --> 00:12:12,450
♪Come, share a cup with me♪
